    {
      "id": "e8a525ee-f940-4d68-8b24-a7feb9a777a6",
      "name": "Pledge Oath",
      "kind": "passage",
      "splitBy": "sentence",
      "source": "Sir, Pledge Oath, Sir\n\nI, Pledge [Name], hereby swear that I am voluntarily and of my own accord duly accepting the responsibilities of a pledge of Pi Alpha Phi. \n\nI promise to accept its rules and regulations, and will conduct myself with dignity on all occasions such that my actions shall not reflect ignobly upon the organisation or its members. \n\nIts rituals, regulations and standards of conduct shall be my guide in all endeavours. \n\nIts aims and purposes shall be my aims and purposes, and in all matters, the fraternity shall be paramount in my eyes. \n\nSir, Pledge Oath, Sir",
      "items": [
