    {
      "id": "8de199ca-872f-407d-bcae-0a539f038a38",
      "name": "Pledge Lessons",
      "kind": "list",
      "source": "What happens in the house stays in the house. \nAlways obey your pledgemaster.\nAsk questions if things are unclear. \nNever disrespect your pledge brother. \nFinish what you start. \nStep up for your pledge brothers.\nPull your own weight.\nAlways trust the actives, especially your big brother. \nShow humility towards the brothers. \nPerfection under any circumstances.\nWhen the why is clear, the how is easy\nWork as a class, cross as a class\nMental fortitude can get you through anything\nA class is only as strong as its weakest link\nUnknown\nDo it right the first time\n \n",
